        "original_id": "587e8d9f-c207-5edd-bad2-286bfff89cfe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Heather Penney\n- Organizations: USAF, United Airlines\n- Events: September 11 attacks, United Airlines Flight 93\n- Places: Washington, DC, Somerset County, Pennsylvania\n\nFacts:\n- On September 11, 2001, during the terrorist attacks, USAF lieutenant Heather Penney was one of two pilots ordered to ram and down United Airlines Flight 93 before it reached Washington, DC.\n- On September 11, 2001, United Airlines Flight 93 crashed into a field in Somerset County, Pennsylvania, while passengers and crew were attempting to regain control of the plane.",
